    <!-- HERO (Seal-style: text + code/demo + 2 cards + trust line) -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Lemma <span class="accent">× x402</span> · Reference implementation</div>
      <h1 class="h1">Trust for AI agent<br><span class="accent">payments.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub"><span class="k">x402</span> lets agents pay. Lemma proves <span class="k">who, under what authority, and on what data</span> — via ZK.</p>

      <div class="hero-grid">
        <pre class="hero-code"><span class="kw">import</span> { <span class="var">wrapFetchWithProof</span> } <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">'@trust402/protocol'</span>

<span class="com">// compose proof gating before the x402 payment</span>
<span class="kw">const</span> <span class="var">fetch402</span> = <span class="fn">wrapFetchWithProof</span>(<span class="var">fetch</span>, <span class="var">artifact</span>, <span class="var">gate</span>, <span class="var">lemma</span>)

<span class="com">// keys and data stay put — only proofs flow</span>
<span class="kw">await</span> <span class="fn">fetch402</span>(<span class="str">'https://api.example/data'</span>)</pre>

        <div class="hero-demo" aria-label="Demo: agent fetches, pays via x402, receives ZK-verified attributes">
          <div class="hero-demo-frame">
            <span class="term-line"><span class="prompt">example-x402$</span><span class="cmd">agent run --pay 0.01 GET /data</span></span>
            <span class="term-line spacer"></span>
            <span class="term-line"><span class="info">[+]</span> generating ZK identity proof… <span class="ok">✓</span></span>
            <span class="term-line"><span class="info">[+]</span> role check (developer-tier)… <span class="ok">✓</span></span>
            <span class="term-line"><span class="info">[+]</span> spendLimit 0.01 ≤ 100 USDC… <span class="ok">✓</span></span>
            <span class="term-line"><span class="info">[+]</span> x402 settle <span class="accent">0x4a8f…e21</span> <span class="ok">✓</span></span>
            <span class="term-line"><span class="info">[+]</span> anchor: Base Sepolia <span class="ok">✓</span></span>
            <span class="term-line spacer"></span>
            <span class="term-line success">200 OK <span class="meta">&#123; data: "…" &#125;</span></span>
            <span class="term-line cursor"><span class="prompt">example-x402$</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-cards">
        <article class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-eyebrow">Try live</div>
          <h3 class="hero-card-h3">Reference<br>implementation</h3>
          <p class="hero-card-copy">A complete working sample on Base Sepolia. <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono); color:var(--lemma-brown); font-size:11.5px">$0.01 GET</span> succeeds with a valid proof and settles; <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono); color:var(--legacy-text); font-size:11.5px">$500 POST</span> exceeds spendLimit and fails closed.</p>
          <a href="https://github.com/lemmaoracle/trust402" class="hero-card-btn muted">View on GitHub →</a>
          <div class="hero-card-microcopy">Open source · live on Base Sepolia</div>
        </article>

        <article class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-badge">MCP Ready</div>
          <div class="hero-card-eyebrow">For agent builders</div>
          <h3 class="hero-card-h3">Drop into your<br>MCP / Agent</h3>
          <p class="hero-card-copy">Use directly from Anthropic MCP, OpenAI Agent SDK, or your own agent harness. Trust402 acts as the payment-verification middleware. SDK ships 2026-06.</p>
          <a href="https://tally.so/r/kd0bZR" class="hero-card-btn primary">Join the waitlist →</a>
          <div class="hero-card-microcopy">Shipping 2026-06</div>
        </article>
      </div>

