        <span class="dot">●</span> <span class="strong">ETHGlobal Open Agents 2026 Finalist</span>
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; Aligned with Coinbase Developer Platform 2026-06 release
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; x402 / MCP standards
        &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="https://github.com/lemmaoracle/trust402" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;">Source on GitHub</a>
